# The templates of ntc-templates 9.3.0 (Apache-2.0, see LICENSE) that rsim
# uses, in the format of the ntc-templates index. The first row that matches a
# command selects its template.
#
# The first rows are the route tables and the access lists, whose
# templates differ from ntc-templates (see the comment at the top of each),
# and `show vrrp`, which ntc-templates does not index and whose answer has
# the form of `show vrrp all`. Their patterns end in `$` or come before the
# ntc-templates rows, so that they win over a row of the same command
# prefix. The other rows are the ntc-templates rows, in the order of the
# ntc-templates index.
#
# abc[[xyz]] is expanded to abc(x(y(z)?)?)?
#
